# The desktop layout by mouse and keys: New Game, Bid 2 by click, the first
# lead by Enter (the focus starts on your first playable card).
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Press New Game
frames 30
save desk-welcome
click =New Game
until 120 Your bid
frames 10
save desk-bid
click =Bid 2
until 600 Your turn
frames 20
save desk-play
key Enter 1
until 200 12 cards
frames 80
save desk-trick
